[SddmGreeterTheme]
Name=Kitsune
Description=Ase, the seven-tailed kitsune, and her seven tarot folds — the Jurai lock, with a mantra gate, at the outer door. Kitsune-mantra, the companion in this package, sets the gate from your session.
